        "createdAt": "2024-11-04T12:39:30.589+00:00",
        "description": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">John Donnelly, Doon East, Gurteen, Co. Sligo</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&amp; formerly of Balbriggan, Co. Dublin.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Peacefully in Sligo University Hospital with his loving family by his side.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Sadly missed by his wife Lenore, his sons Aaron &amp; Jamie &amp; his Mum Meg,</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">extended family, neighbours &amp; friends &amp; his many assorted animals.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>May he rest in peace</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">John will be reposing in Gavin's Funeral Home,</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Knox Street, Ballyhaunis, Co Mayo F35 WF22</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">on Tuesday evening from 7 o'clock</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">concluding with Prayer Service at 8 o'clock.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Removal from Gavin's Funeral Home</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">on Wednesday morning at 11 o'clock</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">for Prayer Service at Lakelands Crematorium,</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Dublin Road, Tullymongan Upper, Cavan H12 RF78</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">at 1 o'clock.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Family Flowers only please, donations, if desired, to North West SPCA.</strong></p>\n",
